.Dd July 1, 2026
.Dt LUXEL 1
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm luxel
.Nd control Luxel recording, editor, export, and transcript workflows
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Op Fl h
.Op Fl -version
.Ar command
.Op Ar options
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm
controls Luxel automation URLs for recording, replay buffer, latest recording,
and settings workflows, and also exposes headless editor export and transcript
workflows.
The installed command name is
.Nm ;
the bundled executable inside the app is
.Nm luxel-cli .
.Pp
Headless exports use Luxel's
.Cm ExportRequest
model and the same native exporter stack as the app.
Interactive terminal progress is written to standard error, leaving standard
output available for file paths and JSON.
AV1 is intentionally not exposed until Luxel ships a registered native AV1
adapter.
.Sh COMMANDS
.Bl -tag -width Ds
.It Cm record
Start a recording.
Requires one capture target:
.Fl -display Ar target ,
.Fl -active-window ,
or
.Fl -last-area .
.It Cm stop
Stop the active recording.
.It Cm toggle
Stop the active recording, or start a recording when a target is provided.
.It Cm clip
Clip the replay buffer.
.It Cm latest
Open the latest recording, or reveal it in Finder with
.Fl -reveal .
.It Cm editor Ar file
Open
.Ar file
in Luxel's editor.
.It Cm convert Ar input Ar output
Convert or edit media headlessly.
The output format is inferred from
.Ar output
unless
.Fl -format
is provided.
.It Cm export Ar request-json Ar output
Export from a full Luxel
.Cm ExportRequest
JSON document.
.It Cm transcribe Ar file
Transcribe a media file.
Plain text is printed to stdout by default.
.It Cm preferences
Open Luxel settings.
Use
.Fl -pane Ar pane
to open
.Cm general ,
.Cm presets ,
.Cm shortcuts ,
.Cm updates ,
or
.Cm about .
.El
.Sh CAPTURE OPTIONS
.Bl -tag -width Ds
.It Fl -display Ar target
Record a display.
Use
.Cm main
for the main display or pass a display identifier.
.It Fl -active-window
Record the active window.
.It Fl -last-area
Record the last selected area.
.It Fl -preset Ar name
Use a Luxel export preset for quick recording.
.It Fl -countdown Ar seconds
Wait 0 to 60 seconds before capture starts.
.It Fl -save-to Ar directory
Save the recording in
.Ar directory .
.El
.Sh HEADLESS EXPORT OPTIONS
.Bl -tag -width Ds
.It Fl -format Ar format
Export format:
.Cm gif ,
.Cm hevc ,
.Cm mp4 ,
.Cm webm ,
.Cm apng ,
.Cm prores422 ,
.Cm prores4444 ,
.Cm m4a ,
.Cm alac ,
.Cm wav ,
.Cm caf ,
or
.Cm flac .
.Pp
Use
.Fl -format
for ambiguous extensions such as
.Pa .mov
and
.Pa .m4a .
.It Fl -width Ar pixels , Fl -height Ar pixels
Resize the export.
Both options must be provided together.
.It Fl -fps Ar frames
Set the output frame rate.
.It Fl -start Ar seconds , Fl -end Ar seconds
Trim to a time range.
.It Fl -duration Ar seconds
Trim to a duration from
.Fl -start .
Cannot be combined with
.Fl -end .
.It Fl -speed Ar value
Set playback speed from 0.1 to 10.
.It Fl -mute
Export without audio.
.It Fl -crop-to-fill
Enable crop-to-fill rendering.
.It Fl -crop Ar x,y,width,height
Set an explicit crop rectangle.
.It Fl -quality Ar quality
Set export quality:
.Cm compact ,
.Cm balanced ,
.Cm high ,
or
.Cm lossless .
.It Fl -overwrite
Replace an existing output file.
.It Fl -json
Print a JSON result instead of the output path.
.It Fl -quiet
Suppress terminal progress output.
.El
.Sh TRANSCRIPT OPTIONS
.Bl -tag -width Ds
.It Fl -locale Ar identifier
Transcribe with a specific locale identifier.
Defaults to the current locale.
.It Fl -output Ar file
Write the transcript to
.Ar file
instead of stdout.
.It Fl -semantic-turns
Use Apple Intelligence turn segmentation.
Raw turn grouping is the default.
.It Fl -json
Print the full transcript JSON instead of plain text.
.It Fl -overwrite
Replace the
.Fl -output
file if it already exists.
.El
.Sh RESULT OPTIONS
.Bl -tag -width Ds
.It Fl -wait
Wait for Luxel to call back with the command result.
.It Fl -json
Wait for the result and print JSON.
.It Fl -timeout Ar seconds
Seconds to wait for a callback before failing.
The default is 120.
.It Fl -print-url , Fl -dry-run
Print the Luxel automation URL instead of opening it.
.It Fl -x-success Ar url
Callback URL for successful execution.
Successful file results append
.Cm filePath ;
recording starts append
.Cm recordingID .
.It Fl -x-error Ar url
Callback URL for failed execution.
Failures append
.Cm errorMessage .
.El
.Sh GLOBAL OPTIONS
.Bl -tag -width Ds
.It Fl h , Fl -help
Show help for a command.
.It Fl -version
Print the Luxel CLI version.
.El
.Sh FILES
.Bl -tag -width Ds
.It Pa Luxel.app/Contents/MacOS/luxel-cli
Bundled command-line executable.
.It Pa Luxel.app/Contents/Resources/man/man1/luxel.1
Bundled manual page.
.El
.Sh EXIT STATUS
.Ex -std
.Sh EXAMPLES
.Bd -literal -offset indent
luxel --version
luxel record --display main --countdown 3
luxel record --active-window --preset "Default" --save-to ~/Movies/Luxel
luxel toggle --last-area
luxel clip --seconds 30 --wait
luxel latest --reveal
luxel preferences --pane shortcuts
luxel record --last-area --print-url
luxel editor ~/Movies/demo.mp4
luxel convert demo.mp4 demo.webm
luxel convert demo.mp4 demo.gif --start 2 --duration 5 --fps 15
luxel convert demo.mp4 demo.mov --format prores422 --quality high
luxel export request.json output.webm --overwrite --json
luxel transcribe demo.m4a > demo.txt
luxel transcribe demo.mp4 --output demo.json --json --overwrite
.Ed
